  "summary": "Rates for a whole machine by the hour, each with the vCPUs, memory and disk that come with it. Where Geodd sells a card one at a time, the figure here is that single-card machine; the 2, 4 and 8-card configurations are exact multiples of it. The H200 SXM5 is sold in one size only, eight cards, so its figure is the machine price divided by eight. Regions are US and EU; the catalogue names none per rate.",
